{"text": " Te treze\u0219ti \u00een anul 1747, la bordul Haleme Seltzbury, un vast de r\u0103zboi britannic \u00een patrulare. \u0218tiai c\u0103 leacul pentru cea mai complet\u0103 boalea marinarilor, a fost g\u0103sit chiar anul \u0103sta, iar Marina a\u0219teptat aproape 50 de ani s\u0103l foloseasc\u0103, uite cea \u00een farfurie. \u00cen fiecare zi o livra de pesmetare \u0219i un galon de b\u0103re, care ne s\u0103rat\u0103 de vita sau de porc, maz\u0103re uscat\u0103, f\u0103in\u0103 de o v\u0103z, pu\u021bin\u0103 br\u00e2nz\u0103, apropie nimic prosp\u0103d. Dup\u0103 c\u00e2teva s\u0103pt\u0103m\u00e2ni pe mare, oamenii fac scorbut, gingii care sunt gereaz\u0103, r\u0103ni vec care se redesquid. Chirurgul navei James Lind, \u00eemparte 12 marinar bolnav de scorbut \u00eemperec \u0219i d\u0103 fiecarei perec el ceva, cidru. O\u021bet, iar o pereche prime\u0219te dou\u0103 portocale \u0219i o l\u0103m\u0103ie pe zi. Deci ce \u00een care va acum au \u00eenleac, \u00een care a potrivit\u0103 de poate vinde ca? Pe uscat \u00een mare abritanie un nou n\u0103scut putea spera tot la mai pu\u021bin de 40 de ani. Marina adat\u0103 \u00eensv\u0103\u0219it sug de l\u0103m\u0103ie abiananul 1795, un secul mai tr\u0103ziu \u00een Japonia, o alt\u0103 pies\u0103 lip s\u0103 \u00eei \u00eei \u00eembol \u00een ve\u0219te pe marinarilor.", "segments": [{"id": 0, "seek": 0, "start": 0.0, "end": 7.84, "text": " Te treze\u0219ti \u00een anul 1747, la bordul Haleme Seltzbury, un vast de r\u0103zboi britannic \u00een patrulare.", "tokens": [50364, 1989, 2192, 1381, 10355, 7317, 15351, 364, 425, 3282, 14060, 11, 635, 25872, 425, 13896, 5729, 318, 2018, 89, 22536, 11, 517, 8369, 368, 367, 4089, 89, 1763, 72, 38389, 969, 299, 15351, 1947, 35972, 543, 13, 50771], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.41933073926327835, "compression_ratio": 1.393305439330544, "no_speech_prob": 0.14158198237419128, "words": [{"word": " Te", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.18, "probability": 0.29694464802742004